# RecipeForge — Environment Variables

Copy this file to `.env` and fill in your keys.
The app works without any keys (falls back to local library + localStorage).

## Spoonacular API (Step 4 — Live Recipe Search)
Get a free key at https://spoonacular.com/food-api
Free tier: 150 requests/day

VITE_SPOONACULAR_KEY=your_spoonacular_key_here

## Firebase (Step 5 — Cloud Sync)
Create a project at https://console.firebase.google.com
Enable: Firestore Database + Anonymous Authentication

VITE_FIREBASE_API_KEY=
VITE_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN=
VITE_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=
VITE_FIREBASE_STORAGE_BUCKET=
VITE_FIREBASE_MESSAGING_SENDER_ID=
VITE_FIREBASE_APP_ID=
